#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Reproducible benchmarking, statistical comparison, tuning, and self-contained reports for MoonBit payloads."
msgstr "面向 MoonBit 负载的可复现基准测试、统计比较、调优与自包含报告。"

#: manual/api/report.md:1
msgid "`report` API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/report.md:3
msgid "`report` projects Plot IR and JSONL events into portable artifacts."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/report.md:5
msgid "`document_from_jsonl` parses observations, validations, failure artifacts, and summaries into plot and differential IR."
msgstr "`document_from_jsonl` 把 observation、validation、failure artifact 与 summary 解析为 plot/differential IR。"

#: manual/api/report.md:6
msgid "Plot projection excludes invalid or infrastructure-failed `(case, implementation, dataset)` keys, invalid observations, and discarded batches."
msgstr "图表投影会排除 validation 为 invalid/infrastructure failure 的 `(case, implementation, dataset)`、无效 observation 与 discarded batch。"

#: manual/api/report.md:7
msgid "`plot_json` emits valid escaped `mmks_1` JSON."
msgstr "`plot_json` 输出已正确转义的 `mmks_1` JSON。"

#: manual/api/report.md:8
msgid "`plot_svg` emits accessible SVG with dynamic scales, axes, labels, legends, tooltips, and series colors."
msgstr "`plot_svg` 输出带动态尺度、坐标轴、标签、图例、tooltip 和系列颜色的可访问 SVG。"

#: manual/api/report.md:9
msgid "`html` emits a report with mismatch rows, flags diffs, capability coverage, corpus denominators, minimal counterexamples, inline CSS, and SVG."
msgstr "`html` 输出 mismatch、flags diff、能力覆盖、corpus 分母、最小反例及内嵌 CSS/SVG。"

#: manual/api/report.md:11
msgid "Scaling, interval, and change-point plots connect per-series category averages. Raw distribution, block order, outlier, and Pareto plots use points. Heatmap plots use colored cells. Exact signatures are in `src/report/pkg.generated.mbti`."
msgstr "Scaling、interval、change-point 连接各系列的类别均值；raw distribution、block order、outlier、Pareto 使用点；heatmap 使用色块。精确签名见 `src/report/pkg.generated.mbti`。"

#: manual/api/report.md:15
msgid "Projection boundary"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/report.md:17
msgid "`document_from_jsonl` is a pure projection from the event stream to `ir_model.PlotDocument`. It does not read files, inspect the host, rerun a worker, or recompute a validation oracle. The CLI owns stdin/filesystem paths; library callers can provide a JSONL string directly."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/report.md:22
msgid "The projection keeps protocol metadata, environment and capability coverage, corpus denominators, flags, validation mismatches, and minimal counterexamples. It drops only observations that cannot support a valid plot: invalid outcomes, infrastructure failures, and discarded batches. A rejected candidate remains visible in the differential section so the report cannot imply “faster and correct” from timing rows alone."
msgstr ""

