#: manual/package_reference.md:10
msgid "`model` is the protocol vocabulary shared by every other package. It contains version identifiers (`mmkp_1`, `mmka_1`, `mmks_1`), dataset and measurement keys, execution outcomes, environment snapshots, run protocols, observations, validation events, replay specifications, and tuning/report metadata."
